      ],
      "content": "This digital object is a motion-capture-derived visualization of Sei Moon Baak Daa 四門逼打, documenting Hakka Kung Fu and featuring Oscar Lam. It was derived from the corresponding MoCap data, used in the Re-Actor installation, and shown in the exhibition 300 Years of Hakka Kung Fu."
